<title>SRI LANKA: Agalawatte net more than doubles.</title>
<headline>Agalawatte net more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	    (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  H1 1996	    H1 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		  298.83    vs	227.34</p>
<p>    Net profit		 42.57    vs	 17.55</p>
<p>NOTE: Agalawatte Plantations Ltd is one of six estate firms privatised in 1995. Company profits are not taxed due to brought forward tax losses. Results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
